{"id":"vod_sn_39159","vodId":"39159","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔法小歌王","name_cn":"魔法小歌王","date":"1994-01-01","year":"1994","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/57213d28b366beefedad7eb6fd82eb7d.jpg"},"summary":"从小就被圣音痴之家的鲁里米索先生收养，在私立无伴奏学校学唱卡拉OK的麦克风次郎（高山みなみ 配音），因为是音痴，他一唱歌能把窗户震坏，让同学们崩溃。而自以为唱歌最好而傲慢的若王子殿（小林优子 配音）更是鄙视他，并向他父亲学校的理事长若王子大殿（佐藤正治 配音）告状要把次郎开除出学校去。一心想唱好歌的次郎好朋友舟木吉道（柏仓つとむ 配音）家里经营着蛇之道卡拉OK连锁店，他缠着舟木要去练歌。王子和妹妹若王子姬（江森浩子 配音）没安好心，邀请次郎唱卡拉OK，那里其实是整人屋，当次郎将要遇到危险时，却得到了父母留给他的能使他成为真正卡拉OK麦克风战士的麦克风。王子要抢麦克风，却意外用自己的戒指打开了次郎被上了锁的声带。没想到声带解锁后，次郎的声音竟犹如天籁......","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:50","playable":true,"episodeCount":20,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kBDDLZHWm31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6Z8kVgm2bz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HfjHDg8LpH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gXLP85zLWb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tC3Gu7kYU21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ewET4RX1wY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5bbmCcchMu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UaJtcybaPb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RPKCKHaYgr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gW62PFQJ961/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GCGyRKZCTX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cf8qztQ8VH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c4nXRh5d091/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/